WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Open the Experiments console to test how your protected route behaves under controlled stress.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Select a target gateway route and choose a fault profile such as 800ms Latency Injection.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Write a falsifiable verification hypothesis describing expected degradation and recovery bounds.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Review blast-radius safety parameters, check explicit operator authorization, and click Execute Chaos.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Monitor worker execution status and inspect failed background jobs in the Dead-Letter Queue if needed.
